        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///// Drill Rocket mining Action Game ! /////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid hard rocks and obstacles and reach the goal !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lots of ore and buy power-up items such as HP up, SPEED delay, and Ultimate Skill at the SHOP to get an advantage in the game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various mechanisms that will twist your brain !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turtle : Avoid at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeadEnd : Look ahead and decide your route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BarrierMachine : Match color of gadget you are wearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper rocket goes into the mine, the more complex these mechanisms become, making the game even more difficult ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right route and break through the 1200th wall !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Normal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard difficulty.  Make the most of the SHOP.  If you need, store lot energy for your Ultimate Skill and break through !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is 1600th Wall, must collect points such as ore for each wall, UltimateSkill energy can only be stored up to 100% (1 use), WallSkip (checkpoint) range increased from 100 to 200 Walls, etc. Challenging difficulty with added difficult conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Hardest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is 1600st Wall. You will only be able to buy WallSkip in the SHOP. Very difficult difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your preferred difficulty and enjoy the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///// Drill Rocket mining Action Game ! /////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid hard rocks and obstacles and reach the goal !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lots of ore and buy power-up items such as HP up, SPEED delay, and Ultimate Skill at the SHOP to get an advantage in the game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various mechanisms that will twist your brain !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turtle : Avoid at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeadEnd : Look ahead and decide your route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BarrierMachine : Match color of gadget you are wearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper rocket goes into the mine, the more complex these mechanisms become, making the game even more difficult ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right route and break through the 1200th wall !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Normal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard difficulty.  Make the most of the SHOP.  If you need, store lot energy for your Ultimate Skill and break through !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is 1600th Wall, must collect points such as ore for each wall, UltimateSkill energy can only be stored up to 100% (1 use), WallSkip (checkpoint) range increased from 100 to 200 Walls, etc. Challenging difficulty with added difficult conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Hardest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is 1600st Wall. You will only be able to buy WallSkip in the SHOP. Very difficult difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your preferred difficulty and enjoy the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Drill Rocket mining Action Game! Avoid approaching obstacles and aim for the goal! Get lots of ores and buy power-up items at the shop! /// Various mechanisms that will confuse your brain appear!! And, the tricky mechanisms are randomly combined, sure to cause chaos!!!",
